#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89fc1a76595cfde73261d7edbcba4ef225b944248c76c12c7d2cd9adc2eeeb9e
#. default-sha256: 946bcab356e8258acefca24a04d4f770faef31ca36ff6c47b2764ce465dc1680
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫마리아를 따라 걷는 백발 소녀는 ⟪k:7⟫난처한 표정을 지었지만, "
"⟪k:8⟫내심 즐거워 보이기도 했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 760a23e9d82e31cd455802f4386685a1d2ffaa397fa652236409d8e94c207bbc
#. default-sha256: 81d6731fcfabab4ef04de706851533accb5f74860ec0f8d9315b872b849406df
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫동성 친구조차 없던 나날을 보낸 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫이렇게 손을 잡아 주는 사람이 나타날 줄은 ⟪k:2⟫상상"
"도 못 했을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a16562de6bf43d4821781488e17e7fe844ba87357f442e43d080b077626d0f8
#. default-sha256: 036370d8c9832d61496214932c16038289d1309b4be137db46036a7ad020f25f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아무도 없는 ⟪k:1⟫밤 시간 복도. ⟪k:2⟫그런 ⟪k:3⟫고요하고 적적한 길도 ⟪k:4⟫마리아가 있으면 밝아"
"지는 것 같았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57af92a2faeecd58a7a741cec5ddf492aa0f468af86c1bb67d41e6bccced614b
#. default-sha256: e3848cc4cbda0b623829d892fdaa20696015b0c240a6b0c634e4e6822d312f74
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어둠 속에서 소녀를 돌아본 마리아는 ⟪k:1⟫장난스럽게 웃으며 검지를 쉿, 입술 위에 댔습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c080d115e8718b74ea5be7cec08704856d53e36144d260ed91665f1fc7624cf
#. default-sha256: 0c69e22ce18edd5bad83714974582828026c64d6e19be47ef2bd0767b2969850
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 그런 동작에 ⟪k:1⟫웃음을 흘렸습니다. ⟪k:2⟫비밀 놀이를 즐기는 듯한 둘은 ⟪k:3⟫꽃다운 처"
"녀 같았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37b66253db46ff6c9ba2e7e51efe8dfb0c7eb4df6003039f7925783a33cf121d
#. default-sha256: 192d56653080e6c0868a6b4927738039027583db10fca3fad129e07fb9a97cfd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫머지않아 ⟪k:1⟫둘은 메인 홀에 도착했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 493016a1db804403fb6e5c2ed79c89a7a680519901806334a247408b3a051fd3
#. default-sha256: ab1f6a659ece55eaded28415545a872fb734d433f42d2e8b2e3f9a6264dcadf0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫어, ⟪k:10⟫어째선지 ⟪k:11⟫여기 올 때까지 ⟪k:12⟫많"
"이 두근거렸어요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a932b2d58913be459ac1058f435352d46ecdfe970bd7b04f701309ff1ae1d3
#. default-sha256: 878a2c7d61ef1e938a3ca6488ec3436c3fba7d4cf35aa1fbcdc3494cd7bb58ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫두근거릴 필요가 어디에 있어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫몹쓸 짓을 하는 것도 아닌데."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 365b490745815ec323a457d65f01a0dafcbdb6894bb630cdf8cd0a9e18508165
#. default-sha256: 5c0ae08e6ac32282dac56e309cb6a4ec22e31f0bd3a59a328238aa0db14328dd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫밤중에 일어나 있어도 혼나는 건 ⟪k:2⟫애들만!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫어른이면 ⟪k:5⟫자기 책임이지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e3086e722935dd0c28fa27468c3bc16a9024731def1c80aa9c0c9c22f8aa614
#. default-sha256: cf457868b64d5e0213a0034606c2ee01978722f08f6addde3d3b9d0148317a2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫후후……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3fd9400eb1167c13b7d6d58c93cbc6dca24cd600f169e96f120504cc57c2134
#. default-sha256: 0874dbf62b09ed68f57fdc5cbcf8c67e3304f1f790a4395b995e5499fca76308
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런데 ⟪k:2⟫여자끼리 댄스를 추다니 ⟪k:3⟫참 묘한걸요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1efee949f914165f60909a6d24945e1abdd94d1fe194791ffe806c17b08a44f5
#. default-sha256: 491624e625f10cf89673d918bd8067c03ee093dc28dd9308dc25950a549e2965
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래? ⟪k:2⟫재미만 있으면 ⟪k:3⟫남자든 여자든 상관없어. ⟪k:4⟫내 나라에선 ⟪k:5⟫빙글빙글 돌"
"면서 ⟪k:6⟫가족끼리 춤추기도 해."

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 325ce181f31c5d5cbc3e7f83bf1add085308c7b7c4fa9b457a9d7d5da7fc1659
#. default-sha256: 1d83381d9e3833f1e71584932e93ad15e8cf02895f6972c2e5a844573f6c7176
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫여자끼리라도 재밌을걸!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecc62e5b8fbefa6a132d5bbe6fb347dff7f98c59f025a043c324c349acfbb4a0
#. default-sha256: 03bb95359e53bf1c06ecf9df3b1e009b2bdfdfcd586df2c1e8055ac506d30005
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그렇군요, ⟪k:2⟫마리아의 가족은―― ⟪k:3⟫그렇겠군요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a6b7e86acb771685a6a900a5a811c7f786e1375e9bbead1e9c805c689130948
#. default-sha256: b1b61741173d1f4ef85f5d2a8838786034d164df015914227759bc3bee72e2d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뭐――, ⟪k:2⟫가족은 ⟪k:3⟫이미 없지만."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 538ec6b3def0e5adfff764408b11a74742d47d03d624125932c722e137b1bfd5
#. default-sha256: a2957c805096faba65347c6ae1329d6581148ffe5124aebe074103e6596e9f27
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네………?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 450e9928733dec7135c3044fc9f33c4a897ae99d49cf996019b24c565c6f2a08
#. default-sha256: d871fcf8f2ddfd477dddb507936e1f537bd4054bdde51ed16c8613e2c2f6bb48
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그럼 ⟪k:2⟫내가 시범을 보여 줄게.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫잘 외워, ⟪k:5⟫다음은 마님 차례야!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1eb58ff66335d0bb432aadc819922e7b94aec005a30d742a46c46cd238b813f8
#. default-sha256: 4ac2bbf7b7c366cf74aaf5ef5083d6f6dcc6622117904348e8d6f336bf5b7e72
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아……, ⟪k:2⟫네, ⟪k:3⟫네."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d49bc2f0b400bad14d6dabe8eb51dce68a3a407b12afeefb3cc3068d6a0994c
#. default-sha256: d2961230036294879b8682233dcc475a2ee7446c039896317c36fe0b795eafd5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마리아는 환하게 웃은 후, ⟪k:4⟫작게 휘파람을 불면서 ⟪k:5⟫사뿐히 스텝을 밟기 시"
"작했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f7193b73d023a7b4130dca958d4aa1a3f2d1866d42444537f80e26938000068
#. default-sha256: ec07362054d537cfc16fd2cebecdc5ebb4c278955abc103d58e53ebda5750305
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 사교계에서 보는 ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫복잡스러운 스텝은 아니었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46309d2a7bc5d0dd10c8a6b26ad0a077c3af775a43a9b8ab5e32ad8d10193051
#. default-sha256: ee6cc88e86f047ef8bda72297768d764b9163d52a42afa5b018ca529744ccf6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫단순한 동작으로만 이어지는 ⟪k:1⟫소박한 춤. ⟪k:2⟫민속무용일 겁니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫마리아의 어레인지"
"도 들어갔을 수 있겠군요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 449fa2e359a97d71bc27d3b82c0a2a940530f67891917ba461a4e8a19d621d0c
#. default-sha256: e7f01928654f345e55d5829948e386fcae696e5771364a3b8fb9f9c585996b62
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀는 그 모습을 넋 놓고 바라보았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2fe87843dbf926ef3c45fa34be0a6396a46a136a4357877d1b346fc5ba74d6a
#. default-sha256: 99611d20e3d097a736413c86b758afaecc02c38282f686886801d66b206698db
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구나 따라할 수 있는 동작의 연속도 ⟪k:1⟫마리아가 하니 ⟪k:2⟫약동감이 넘쳤습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9e5cf306b60cfaf64013c456e5b4e2adf12b05eb044673940b39cb313549780
#. default-sha256: 662ac1ae18bdab638d0f689ae9f3d46d95d25c266c106666035aaf9a2362f4df
