msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫결코 ⟪k:1⟫무도가처럼 매끄러운 동작이 아니며,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫곡예사처럼 각이 선 동작이 아닌데도요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38524efc26c6b7a6c50f5d98dbc7b87a70d6ea3538bade7f5eafdfee26a9f8dd
#. default-sha256: 0db83fae29caea2c1891df8339343e096e044b4dcad11af9f9b2d1f5040e8053
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was her own, lively, beautiful self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 ⟪k:1⟫마리아의 생명력이 넘치는 ⟪k:2⟫아름다운 동작이었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecffb7062d8770f7b510554ca3cf8c38d7506981a8ddc13f96f6f8a9a603bb7b
