msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria twirled in place, the skirt of her maid uniform billowing gently up around her. ⟪k:1⟫"
"With a smile, she extended her hand toward the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마리아가 크게 회전하면 ⟪k:1⟫메이드복 옷자락이 완만히 나풀거렸지요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마리아는 웃으며 "
"⟪k:4⟫소녀에게 손을 내밀었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23ffdad051ff7fa38afa883c9abb9440ff315bf82e6925df4ecd55a961fa1f96
#. default-sha256: 2045b4dea95260a7b12222969de4004759bff0d083901bf80ddc4d17c57f6f18
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She hesitated for a moment, but as if being pulled forward by some invisible force, she took "
"Maria’s hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는 잠시 망설이다가 ⟪k:1⟫마치 이끌리듯이 ⟪k:2⟫그 손을 잡았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9338908c67e99d9f5fb732706aa5afc30e018dcd7ae74c8cc12e031b64cb125a
