msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was just the two of them, but you could almost see the crowd forming around them..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫단 둘만의 댄스였습니다. ⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫둘을 둘러싼 수많은 청중, ⟪k:3⟫춤에 끼려는 소박한 사"
"람들――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2453acc57c7b27a822c1d36898b6eefbb35acbdc0e27d132d9ef13552a607a5
#. default-sha256: 4850a9d4c7ee2ad548e93802c8aead03fd55d7c6be5049fec802204fe21e053d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the other people stepping up to join in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 게 ⟪k:1⟫실제로 보이는 것만 같았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 248fe53d239176b795dc6e1cf7f13bb60206945fb4999d77dd61615a5c9dfb5f
