msgid "⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫This is not easy, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m having trouble following along..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어, ⟪k:1⟫어려워요, ⟪k:2⟫마리아. ⟪k:3⟫제대로 ⟪k:4⟫못 하겠어요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acb93e0b43a8db3c695d69c34ffda58b2b599b507056741ce866034f2f2fc830
#. default-sha256: d993527a1fdc53570879aa92b0a25df273788f9d06f9034c2567ec612a331f8a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You can do it!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Looking good so far!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re a natural, Madam!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫할 수 있어! ⟪k:1⟫잘 추고 있어. ⟪k:2⟫마님 댄스에 소질 있나 봐!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 396ca45d5f942316e74e1271f9a8683aeaa50d483cf03592fd49c388b70243e6
