msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I won’t fall for your flattery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫에이, ⟪k:1⟫마리아도 참……. ⟪k:2⟫억지로 칭찬해도 ⟪k:3⟫안 통해요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2933ccc11e7c2e3d1755c123249c183bfdbc65198f9cc894c9488285627f0839
