msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The whispers of the two girls.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their muffled laughs.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Step, hop, step, step."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The rustling of fabric."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫두 여성의 말과 ⟪k:1⟫작은 웃음소리.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이어서 스텝. ⟪k:4⟫옷이 나풀거리는 소리."

#: scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 631dd7f021307454c9e6294816a831eaeabdc36dd3772e95ed9ec8e8fb90fa8b
