msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many different soft sounds layered atop one another, creating a little bubble of happiness "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이런 것들이 한 데 모여 ⟪k:1⟫홀에 소박한 행복이 드리웠습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61f83ad5310c6e3e0b2a331dc9c651a4282ae25b7882cc9979d4964e27b9151a
#. default-sha256: bfe73704acf7c8398cb08dfadd480c6f77758e022c01e531f0aa7df916e1fc37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl’s movements were a great deal clumsier than Maria’s, but Maria would "
"never disparage her for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마리아에 비하면 ⟪k:1⟫동작이 어설픈 소녀였으나, ⟪k:2⟫마리아가 그걸 나무랄 리 만무했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b3ce4ffc29dc84667500649108569012ad295b24a75e6a030836bc501be9ffc
#. default-sha256: 0d97a596816c732c47b81822bd5e02699a8f77e3eb17191361b807b16b03a7b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the contrary, she showered her with praise. ⟪k:1⟫As flustered as the White-Haired Girl "
"appeared, I imagine she was quite pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫오히려 마리아는 ⟪k:1⟫소녀를 꾸준히 칭찬했지요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫소녀도 쑥스러워하긴 해도 ⟪k:4⟫내심 기"
"뻤을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff04deabc83e38d6e5bab8e3edf30adede30f25b3f7a4292c0cf6138718b8b7a
#. default-sha256: 9d553445b8e4f14624f752858e06be21a7917428043795d3711b8511d2454a40
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, the tightness in her face muscles loosened, a smile spread across her lips, and "
"she began to brighten up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫표정이 풀어지곤, ⟪k:1⟫미소를 지어 ⟪k:2⟫확 밝아졌거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ef72b9b1cddd77376ec156024756d85671b0d321b165a45fc1fd5a0ed5c07a0
#. default-sha256: 682db39db980ec79016916afb396457fc23db572e83cbcd74c33eab7ced1180c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See?⟪k:1⟫What’d I tell ya?⟪k:2⟫Fun, huh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫자, ⟪k:2⟫재밌지 않아? ⟪k:3⟫어때?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dd81d843b0ed41fac2061a12c7fb26c4ac8da1fbc7d4d14fba1c17737afa01d
#. default-sha256: 437d06471e8f302e13eb090a4b0f5669b61cdafa5cb715d45f232cea2c5a4504
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes. I am quite surprised—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫both that I ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ dance and that I enjoy "
"doing it so much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫네――, ⟪k:1⟫놀라워요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제가 춤을 추는 것도, ⟪k:4⟫춤이 이렇게 ⟪k:5⟫즐겁단 것도요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43bb6339f86f794d914b7d95b127f67922539f5cc116200aa680fb927e7d27de
#. default-sha256: 4bc03e88f8839ae384119351370ff06d0699357c470b68bdde550b9bd9de1bbc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Glad to hear it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하하――, ⟪k:1⟫다행인걸!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6856af003535e21b224a2cbe4821e5465a7998028078eafe341262bcaa831013
